tive drawing. Low-latency touch response under 8ms for natural interaction. Pre-loaded with interactive art applications and SDK for custom development. Perfect for museums, science centers, and interactive exhibitions.\", \"sku\": \"BL-ART-TWI25\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/touchwall-interactive-p25\", \"category\": \"art-immersive\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_touchwall-interactive-p25.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 10000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/touchwall-interactive-p25\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"2.5mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"800 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the TouchWall Interactive P2.5?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The TouchWall Interactive P2.5 features a fine pixel pitch of 2.5mm, ensuring high-resolution and crisp visuals ideal for detailed interactive art and educational content.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How many touch points does the LED wall support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It supports up to 32-point multi-touch simultaneously, allowing multiple users to interact with the display at the same time for collaborative experiences.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the touch latency and why is it important?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The touch latency is less than 8 milliseconds, which ensures responsive, real-time interaction making gestures and drawing feel natural and fluid.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I develop custom applications for this LED wall?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the TouchWall comes with a dedicated SDK allowing developers to create customized interactive content tailored to specific use cases and environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the display and is it suitable for bright environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness level of 800 nits, the display is suitable for indoor environments such as museums and education centers, providing vivid and clear visuals even under ambient lighting.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of warranty and support is provided?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a standard warranty covering hardware defects and support services. Detailed warranty terms can be provided upon inquiry to ensure long-term reliability.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the TouchWall compare to traditional touchscreen displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike traditional screens, this LED wall offers a large-format, immersive experience with multi-user interaction, infrared touch technology, object detection, and superior brightness, making it ideal for public installations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Where are the best places to install the TouchWall Interactive P2.5?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It is best installed in museums, science centers, interactive exhibitions, and educational institutions, where engaging visitors with interactive digital content enhances learning and entertainment.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"TouchWall Interactive P2.5\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/touchwall-interactive-p25\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>TouchWall Interactive P2.5</h1><p>Discover TouchWall Interactive P2.5 LED walls in Dubai for engaging user experiences. Contact Brightluxx UAE today for advanced interactive LED solutions.</p><p><strong>Multi-touch LED wall for interactive art and education.</strong></p><p>Large-format interactive LED wall with 32-point multi-touch capability via infrared overlay. Supports gesture recognition, object detection, and collaborative drawing. Low-latency touch response under 8ms for natural interaction. Pre-loaded with interactive art applications and SDK for custom development. Perfect for museums, science centers, and interactive exhibitions.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the TouchWall Interactive P2.5?</h3><p>The TouchWall Interactive P2.5 features a fine pixel pitch of 2.5mm, ensuring high-resolution and crisp visuals ideal for detailed interactive art and educational content.</p><h3>How many touch points does the LED wall support?</h3><p>It supports up to 32-point multi-touch simultaneously, allowing multiple users to interact with the display at the same time for collaborative experiences.</p><h3>What is the touch latency and why is it important?</h3><p>The touch latency is less than 8 milliseconds, which ensures responsive, real-time interaction making gestures and drawing feel natural and fluid.</p><h3>Can I develop custom applications for this LED wall?</h3><p>Yes, the TouchWall comes with a dedicated SDK allowing developers to create customized interactive content tailored to specific use cases and environments.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n9:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"products\\\",\\\"touchwall-interactive-p25\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"slug\\\",\\\"products/touchwall-interactive-p25\\\",\\\"c\\\",[\\\"products\\\"]],{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"script-0\\\",{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\",\\\"async\\\":true,\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"html\\\",null,{\\\"lang\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"body\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$