"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n15:T61e,\\u003ch1\\u003eTouchWall Interactive P2.5\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eDiscover TouchWall Interactive P2.5 LED walls in Dubai for engaging user experiences. Contact Brightluxx UAE today for advanced interactive LED solutions.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eMulti-touch LED wall for interactive art and education.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eLarge-format interactive LED wall with 32-point multi-touch capability via infrared overlay. Supports gesture recognition, object detection, and collaborative drawing. Low-latency touch response under 8ms for natural interaction. Pre-loaded with interactive art applications and SDK for custom development. Perfect for museums, science centers, and interactive exhibitions.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the pixel pitch of the TouchWall Interactive P2.5?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe TouchWall Interactive P2.5 features a fine pixel pitch of 2.5mm, ensuring high-resolution and crisp visuals ideal for detailed interactive art and educational content.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow many touch points does the LED wall support?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIt supports up to 32-point multi-touch simultaneously, allowing multiple users to interact with the display at the same time for collaborative experiences.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the touch latency and why is it important?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe touch latency is less than 8 milliseconds, which ensures responsive, real-time interaction making gestures and drawing feel natural and fluid.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eCan I develop custom applications for this LED wall?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes, the TouchWall comes with a dedicated SDK allowing developers to create customized interactive content tailored to specific use cases and environments.\\u003c/p