tps://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the TouchWall Interactive P2.5?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The TouchWall Interactive P2.5 features a fine pixel pitch of 2.5mm, ensuring high-resolution and crisp visuals ideal for detailed interactive art and educational content.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How many touch points does the LED wall support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It supports up to 32-point multi-touch simultaneously, allowing multiple users to interact with the display at the same time for collaborative experiences.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the touch latency and why is it important?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The touch latency is less than 8 milliseconds, which ensures responsive, real-time interaction making gestures and drawing feel natural and fluid.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I develop custom applications for this LED wall?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the TouchWall comes with a dedicated SDK allowing developers to create customized interactive content tailored to specific use cases and environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the display and is it suitable for bright environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness level of 800 nits, the display is suitable for indoor environments such as museums and education centers, providing vivid and clear visuals even under ambient lighting.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of warranty and support is provided?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a standard warranty covering hardware defects and support services. Detailed warranty terms can be provided upon inquiry to ensure long-term reliability.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the TouchWall compare to traditional touchscreen displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike traditional screens, this LED wall offers a large-format, immersive experience with multi-user interaction, infrared touch technology, object detection, and superior brightness, making it ideal for public installations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Where are the best places to install the TouchWall Interactive P2.5?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It is best installed in museums, science centers, interactive exhibitions, and educational institutions, where engaging visitors with interactive digital content enhances learning and entertainment.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"TouchWall Interactive P2.5\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/touchwall-interactive-p25\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T61e,<h1>TouchWall Interactive P2.5</h1><p>Discover TouchWall Interactive P2.5 LED walls in Dubai for engaging user experiences. Contact Brightluxx UAE today for advanced interactive LED solutions.</p><p><strong>Multi-touch LED wall for interactive art and education.</strong></p><p>Large-format interactive LED wall with 32-point multi-touch capability via infrared overlay. Supports gesture recognition, object detection, and collaborative drawing. Low-latency touch response under 8ms for natural interaction. Pre-loaded with interactive art applications and SDK for custom development. Perfect for museums, science centers, and interactive exhibitions.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the TouchWall Interactive P2.5?</h3><p>The TouchWall Interactive P2.5 features a fine pixel pitch of 2.5mm, ensuring high-resolution and crisp visuals ideal for detailed interactive art and educational content.</p><h3>How many touch points does the LED wall support?</h3><p>It supports up to 32-point multi-touch simultaneously, allowing multiple users to interact with the display at the same time for collaborative experiences.</p><h3>What is the touch latency and why is it important?</h3><p>The touch latency is less than 8 milliseconds, which ensures responsive, real-time interaction making gestures and drawing feel natural and fluid.</p><h3>Can I develop custom applications for this LED wall?</h3><p>Yes, the TouchWall comes with a dedicated SDK allowing developers to create customized interactive content tailored to specific use cases and environments.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"TouchWall Interactive P2.5 LED Wall - Dubai Interactive Displays | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"