on\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the TouchWall Interactive P2.5?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The TouchWall Interactive P2.5 features a fine pixel pitch of 2.5mm, ensuring high-resolution and crisp visuals ideal for detailed interactive art and educational content.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How many touch points does the LED wall support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It supports up to 32-point multi-touch simultaneously, allowing multiple users to interact with the display at the same time for collaborative experiences.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the touch latency and why is it important?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The touch latency is less than 8 milliseconds, which ensures responsive, real-time interaction making gestures and drawing feel natural and fluid.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I develop custom applications for this LED wall?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the TouchWall comes with a dedicated SDK allowing developers to create customized interactive content tailored to specific use cases and environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the display and is it suitable for bright environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness level of 800 nits, the display is suitable for indoor environments such as museums and education centers, providing vivid and clear visuals even under ambient lighting.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of warranty and support is provided?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a standard warranty covering hardware defects and support services. Detailed warranty terms can be provided upon inquiry to ensure long-term reliability.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the TouchWall compare to traditional touchscreen displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike traditional screens, this LED wall offers a large-format, immersive experience with multi-user interaction, infrared touch technology, object detection, and superior brightness, making it ideal for public installations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Where are the best places to install the TouchWall Interactive P2.5?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It is best installed in museums, science centers, interactive exhibitions, and educational institutions, where engaging visitors with interactive digital content enhances learning and entertainment.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"TouchWall Interactive P2.5\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/touchwall-interactive-p25\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalN