/h1><p>Discover TouchWall Interactive P2.5 LED walls in Dubai for engaging user experiences. Contact Brightluxx UAE today for advanced interactive LED solutions.</p><p><strong>Multi-touch LED wall for interactive art and education.</strong></p><p>Large-format interactive LED wall with 32-point multi-touch capability via infrared overlay. Supports gesture recognition, object detection, and collaborative drawing. Low-latency touch response under 8ms for natural interaction. Pre-loaded with interactive art applications and SDK for custom development. Perfect for museums, science centers, and interactive exhibitions.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the TouchWall Interactive P2.5?</h3><p>The TouchWall Interactive P2.5 features a fine pixel pitch of 2.5mm, ensuring high-resolution and crisp visuals ideal for detailed interactive art and educational content.</p><h3>How many touch points does the LED wall support?</h3><p>It supports up to 32-point multi-touch simultaneously, allowing multiple users to interact with the display at the same time for collaborative experiences.</p><h3>What is the touch latency and why is it important?</h3><p>The touch latency is less than 8 milliseconds, which ensures responsive, real-time interaction making gestures and drawing feel natural and fluid.</p><h3>Can I develop custom applications for this LED wall?</h3><p>Yes, the TouchWall comes with a dedicated SDK allowing developers to create customized interactive content tailored to specific use cases and environments.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"TouchWall Interactive P2.5 LED Wall - Dubai Interactive Displays | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Discover TouchWall Interactive P2.5 LED wall